heck out the shop with multiple cosmetics you \ncan put on to style your Langur! Or, if you are basic, just change your colors.\nLangur Run is still brand new, so expect bugs. \n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "This is Langur Run, an experience similar to Gorilla Tag! Check out the brand-new shop! \nwith a whole bunch of cosmetics to put on and style your Langur, be careful don't spend all of your money!"}]}, "developer_name": "star.mp4", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QurlQWMRUzCsKiDm8TAioVnUPAja2EDaUWmd-ZDEzKg/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "star.mp4/Doritoz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LangurRun", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8619702564787381"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001705_2470195483176943_3388188711557977575_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AVPDlOb6-HQQ7kNvwHSlwSd&_nc_oc=AdoTDzVsyF1VGIwx40siPb-gKglaVNahpccc7Ty7lA2wO6BGm56wvnjKb8u5LdeU_XA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af39ylEnOw6-2UW2-2GfM2G-iQafbbRv3tHzPn1KpNyISQ&oe=69D3AFB8"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Langur Run", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "c